	<div class="wrap" style='font-size:15px; margin-top:20px;'>
		Tip:
		In order to be able to use the TEST4U posts in the Menus follow the steps:  <br />
		<ol> 
			<li>Go to <b>Appearance</b> > <b>Menus</b></li>
			<li>Click on <b>Screen Options</b></li>
			<li>Select the TEST4U checkbox and close Screen Options</li>
		</ol> 

	</div>

	<div style='margin-top:50px;'>
		<h2>Troubleshooting</h2>
		If you get a 404 error (Post not found) after publishing your course follow the steps:<br />
		<ol>
			<li>Goto Settings > <a href='options-permalink.php'>Permalinks</a></li>
			<li>Click the <b>Save Changes</b> button</li>
		</ol>
	
	</div>
